ong> A dirty AC works harder, consuming more power.</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <span><strong>Frequent Breakdowns:</strong> Lack of care leads to expensive <strong>split ac compressor failure</strong>.</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <span><strong>Health Issues:</strong> Mold in ducts can cause respiratory problems.</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <span><strong>Unpleasant Odors:</strong> Bacterial growth causes foul smells in the room.</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <span><strong>Water Damage:</strong> Clogged drains lead to water dripping indoors.</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <span><strong>Reduced Cooling:</strong> You wont feel the cooling even at the lowest temperature setting.</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <span><strong>Costly Repairs:</strong> Small ignored issues turn into major replacement costs.</span></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- PRICING TABLE -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-2\">Affordable AC Service Price List</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-500 mb-8\">Transparent pricing for <strong>split ac service godhra</strong></p>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg\">\n                <table class=\"price-table\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>Service Description</t