      </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-center mt-6\">\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-godhra-gujarat\" class=\"inline-block border-2 border-blue-600 text-blue-600 px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white transition\">View Full Price List</a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- BRANDS SECTION -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16 py-8\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">We Service All Major Brands</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-center mb-8 text-gray-600\">We are experts in repairing all major brands available in Gujarat (Online &#038; Offline)</p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\">\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Voltas</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">LG</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Samsung</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Daikin</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Hitachi</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Blue Star</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Panasonic</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Carrier</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Lloyd</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Mitsubishi</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Godrej</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">O General</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Whirlpool</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Haier</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-gray-700\">Toshiba</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-xs mt-4 text-gray-500\">Note: We are a multi-brand service center and not exclusively authorized by specific brands, allowing us to offer cost-effective post-warranty solutions.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- INDUSTRIAL & RESIDENTIAL AREAS -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n            <!-- Residential -->\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-8 rounded-2xl\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-blue-900\"><i class=\"fas fa-home mr-2\"></i> Residential Areas Served</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">\n                    Bamroli Road | Vavadi | Bhuravav | Vejalpur Road | Dahod Road | Lunawada Road | Civil Lines | Polan Bazar | Signal Falia | Shanti Nagar | Chitra Road | Bus Stand Area | Railway Station Area.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Industrial -->\n            <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-8 rounded-2xl\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-orange-900\"><i class=\"fas fa-industry mr-2\"></i> Industrial GIDC Areas Served</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">\n                    Godhra GIDC | Vavadi Industrial Area | Halol GIDC (Nearby) | Kalol GIDC (Nearby).\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ERROR CODES -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">Common Split AC Error Codes We Fix</h3>\n            <p class=\"mb-4\">Modern Inverter ACs display error codes when malfunctioning. Our technicians are trained to decode and fix these immediately.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded border\">\n                    <strong class=\"block text-red-600\">E1 / E2 Error</strong>\n                    <span>Usually indicates a room sensor or coil sensor fault.</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded border\">\n                    <strong class=\"block text-red-600\">E5 / E6 Error</strong>\n                    <span>Often related to indoor/outdoor communication failure or fan motor issues.</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded border\">\n                    <strong class=\"block text-red-600\">P0 / P4 Error</strong>\n                    <span>Inverter module protection or compressor drive protection active.</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded border\">\n                    <strong class=\"block text-red-600\">H6 Error</strong>\n                    <span>Indoor fan motor not running or feedback error.</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded border\">\n                    <strong class=\"block text-red-600\">F1 / F2 / F3</strong>\n                    <span>Temperature sensor open or short circuit.</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded border\">\n                    <strong class=\"block text-red-600\">EC Error</strong>\n                    <span>Refrigerant leak detection (Gas Leakage).</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- BUY SELL SCRAP -->\n        <section class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900 to-blue-700 text-white p-10 rounded-2xl mb-16 text-center\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">We Buy &#038; Sell Used ACs</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-xl mb-6\">Looking to upgrade? We purchase old, second-hand, and scrap ACs at best prices.</p>\n            <p class=\"mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">We also sell refurbished and tested second-hand split and window ACs with warranty. Perfect for students, temporary offices, or budget-friendly cooling.</p>\n            <a href=\"/shop\" class=\"bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full hover:bg-yellow-300 transition shadow-lg\">Visit Our Shop</a>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- OTHER SERVICES LINKS -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">Other Cooling Services We Offer</h3>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n                 <a href=\"/air-cooler-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">Air Cooler Repair</a>\n                 <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">Chiller Repair</a>\n                 <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">Central AC Repair</a>\n                 <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">Cold Room Repair</a>\n                 <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">Deep Freezer Repair</a>\n                 <a href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">Refrigerator Repair</a>\n                 <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">Ducting Repair</a>\n                 <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">HVAC Repair</a>\n                 <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">Panel AC Service</a>\n                 <a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-blue-100\">Water Cooler Repair</a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQs -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-10\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n            <div class=\"space-y-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n                <!-- FAQ 1 -->\n                <div class=\"border rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\n                    <button class=\"w-full text-left px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center focus:outline-none\">\n                        <span>How often should I service my split AC in Godhra?</span>\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-400\"></i>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"px-6 py-4 bg-white border-t\">\n                        Given Godhra&#8217;s hot and dry climate, we recommend <strong>ac cleaning service</strong> at least twice a year—once before summer starts and once after the monsoon to ensure optimal performance.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- FAQ 2 -->\n                <div class=\"border rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\n                    <button class=\"w-full text-left px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center focus:outline-none\">\n                        <span>Why is water dripping from my Split AC indoor unit?</span>\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-400\"></i>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"px-6 py-4 bg-white border-t\">\n                        Water leakage is usually caused by a clogged drain pipe or a dirty filter. Our <strong>split ac water leakage repair godhra</strong> technicians can clear the blockage using pressure pumps in minutes.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                 <!-- FAQ 3 -->\n                 <div class=\"border rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\n                    <button class=\"w-full text-left px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center focus:outline-none\">\n                        <span>Do you provide bill and warranty on spare parts?</span>\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-400\"></i>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"px-6 py-4 bg-white border-t\">\n                        Yes, all <strong>ac spare parts godhra</strong> we replace come with a manufacturer warranty (usually 3 to 6 months), and we provide a proper invoice for all services rendered.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                 <!-- FAQ 4 -->\n                 <div class=\"border rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\n                    <button class=\"w-full text-left px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center focus:outline-none\">\n                        <span>Can you install an AC bought online?</span>\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-400\"></i>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"px-6 py-4 bg-white border-t\">\n                        Absolutely. We provide <strong>split ac installation near me</strong> for all brands bought from Amazon, Flipkart, or Croma. We ensure proper vacuuming and copper pipe fitting.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                 <!-- FAQ 5 -->\n                 <div class=\"border rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\n                    <button class=\"w-full text-left px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center focus:outline-none\">\n                        <span>Do you serve industrial areas like Godhra GIDC?</span>\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-400\"></i>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"px-6 py-4 bg-white border-t\">\n                        Yes, we have specialized teams for commercial and industrial HVAC needs in Godhra GIDC, Vavadi Industrial Area, and surrounding regions.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white pt-16 pb-8\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n            <!-- Col 1 -->\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon\" class=\"h-16 mb-4 bg-white p-2 rounded\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4\">\n                    Godhra&#8217;s leading HVAC solution provider. We ensure your comfort with fast, reliable, and affordable AC services.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex space-x-4\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white hover:text-blue-400\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white hover:text-pink-400\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white hover:text-blue-400\"><i class=\"fab fa-twitter\"></i></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Col 2 -->\n            <div>\n                <h5 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Quick Links</h5>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                    <li><a href=\"/home\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Home</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/about-us\" class=\"hover:text-white\">About Us</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/blogs\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Blogs</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Privac